    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The “Your turn, Red.” framing and side-by-side ALLOW/BLOCK reveal create a clear, demo-friendly red-team moment across all viewports. Cyan/pink signaling, fused-risk readout, and evidence-layer bars reinforce the concept. However, the core visual language remains a familiar dark cyber dashboard of sliders, pills, progress bars, and bordered cards; no singular visual metaphor or dramatic interaction is evidenced that would make the composer unmistakable after the demo.",
